  "title": "Mango Bread",
  "description": "This moist mango bread is easy to make with chopped fresh mango, shredded coconut, walnuts and easy baking ingredients for a delicious tropical treat!",
  "authors": [
    "YummyMum"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:49:22-04:00",
